I find the best way is to dig a hole in the wall, and kick stuff out
of it.  It's in the spoilers, and it never takes very long.  In
addition, if there is a valuable gem in there, you can take all of the
shopkeepers money, too!  :)
Since some of you don't have the spoilers, I am enclosing the
directions herein.  I hope Paul Waterman doesn't mind, as I am
printing this without permission, but in any case, consider this a
plug.  The spoilers improve your game tremendously...
FYI, in the pictures, X is you, @ is the shopkeeper, f is your pet,
and P is a pile, _not_ a gray ooze (<-- note spelling.  GRAY, not
GREY)
hee hee
-------------The following is from the WCST Nethack Spoilers----------------
Method Two:  Dig a hole in the wall with a wand of digging or any other handy
method of digging, and then kick the stuff out.  Two notes, here:  1) kicking
potions, eggs, or other fragile items will destroy them.  2) You cannot just
kick an item out of the shop - if you do so, the shopkeeper will charge you
for it.  You have to be outside the shop (i.e., in the wall) while you're
kicking it out of the shop.

     Get positioned...   Dig...   #          Make a pile...
     -------------       ----------.--       ----------X--
     |!!$%%[))...|#      |!!$%%[))...|#      |!!.f......P|#
     |$+$$(![[.@.-#      |$+$$(![[.@..f      |.....!....@.#
     |+$%]**!$...|Xf##   |+$%]**!$...|X###   |......!....|####
     -------------       -------------       -------------

     Kick...  #          You're rich!
     ----------X--       ----------.--
     |!!.........|#      |!!........f|#
     |.....!....@P#      |.....!.....X#
     |......!f...|####   |......!..@.|####
